  "details": "World: https://vrchat.com/home/content/worlds/wrld_a1ec23b9-a634-4607-a2ae-85a788c03bc2/edit\n\nStatus: Published; Community Labs\n\nIssue: No one but the owner can set this world as their home, despite being published. Another person with access to the project tried uploading the world as well and encountered the same error when someone else tried to add it as home.\n\nNotes: From a user perspective this is an uninformative or unexpected error. What was the error? Why can't the home world be set? Is the world not eligible? Then why is the button not greyed out? Was there a server error? Then why not give us more information? This error does nothing.",
